{"seq":2,"slug":"the-parton-model","title":"部分子模型","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/core-contributions/other-physics/the-parton-model","wordCount":1550,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"部分子模型\">部分子模型</h1><p>部分子模型（parton model）是费曼 1969 年提出的一幅高能散射图景：把质子看作一群近乎自由的点状组分（部分子），高能碰撞实际是与其中单个部分子的散射。它把斯坦福直线加速器（SLAC）深度非弹性散射的反常数据变得可解释，并在夸克从「数学记号」走向「物理实体」、最终通向量子色动力学（QCD）的过程中充当关键桥梁。本篇讲清它解决的问题、核心论断、与夸克理论的会合，以及边界。它与<a href=\"superfluidity-and-weak-interaction\">超流与弱相互作用</a>同属费曼「QED 之外」的粒子物理贡献，方法上承袭其直觉先行风格（见<a href=\"../../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a>卷）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>部分子模型的核心是一幅可与实验直接对话的动力学图景：<strong>在足够高的能量下，质子近似为一束近乎自由、点状的组分（部分子），高能碰撞实际是与其中单个部分子的弹性散射</strong>。它把不可解的强耦合束缚态问题，化为可计算的非相干部分子求和。</p>\n<p>其效力建立在两条支柱上。其一是<strong>无限动量系</strong>：质子被洛伦兹收缩成薄饼，内部相互作用因时间膨胀而&quot;冻结&quot;，旁观部分子不参与。其二是<strong>标度无关性</strong>：点状部分子没有内禀尺度，结构函数只依赖无量纲的 Bjorken-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 而非能量与动量转移——这正是 SLAC 深度非弹性散射数据中&quot;硬的点状散射中心&quot;信号的理论解释。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>部分子 = 夸克（带电）+ 胶子（中性）</strong>：两条线索 1969 年后会合，使夸克从「数学记号」走向「物理实体」。</li>\n<li><strong>分布函数是非微扰输入</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_i(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 须实验测定，不能纯理论推出，但一经测定即可迁移预测其他高能过程（因子化）。</li>\n<li><strong>边界</strong>：朴素标度只是领头近似，实测的对数标度破坏须由 QCD 的 DGLAP 演化修正；禁闭使夸克永不单独出现。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    PROTON[质子] --&gt; FREE[无限动量系: 近乎自由点状部分子]&#10;    FREE --&gt; DIS[轻子与单个部分子弹性散射]&#10;    DIS --&gt; SCALE[标度无关性: 结构函数只依赖 Bjorken-x]&#10;    SCALE --&gt; SUM[&quot;F2(x) = Σ e_i² x f_i(x)&quot;]&#10;    SUM --&gt; QUARK[部分子 = 夸克 + 胶子]&#10;    QUARK --&gt; QCD[1973 QCD 渐近自由]\">graph TD\n    PROTON[质子] --&gt; FREE[无限动量系: 近乎自由点状部分子]\n    FREE --&gt; DIS[轻子与单个部分子弹性散射]\n    DIS --&gt; SCALE[标度无关性: 结构函数只依赖 Bjorken-x]\n    SCALE --&gt; SUM[\"F2(x) = Σ e_i² x f_i(x)\"]\n    SUM --&gt; QUARK[部分子 = 夸克 + 胶子]\n    QUARK --&gt; QCD[1973 QCD 渐近自由]</pre><h2 id=\"背景-slac-的反常数据\">背景：SLAC 的反常数据</h2><p>1967–1969 年，SLAC-MIT 合作组用高能电子轰击质子（深度非弹性散射，DIS），观测到两个出人意料的结果：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>大角度散射截面远高于预期</strong>——若质子是均匀软团，散射应迅速衰减；实测却暗示内部存在硬的、点状的散射中心，类比卢瑟福用 α 粒子发现原子核。</li>\n<li><strong>标度无关性（Bjorken scaling）</strong>——结构函数在大动量转移下只依赖无量纲变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>，而非单独依赖能量与动量转移。这一行为由比约肯（Bjorken）预言，强烈提示质子由点状组分构成。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"部分子图景\">部分子图景</h2><p>费曼提出：在足够高的能量、用「无限动量参考系」看，质子被洛伦兹收缩成薄饼，内部相互作用因时间膨胀而「冻结」，于是质子近似为一束<strong>几乎自由</strong>的点状部分子。入射轻子（电子）在碰撞瞬间只与<strong>单个</strong>部分子发生弹性散射，其余部分子是旁观者。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    E[高能电子 e⁻] --&gt;|交换虚光子 γ*| P1&#10;    subgraph 质子&#10;        P1((部分子 i))&#10;        P2((部分子))&#10;        P3((部分子))&#10;    end&#10;    P1 --&gt;|被击出| X[末态强子喷注]&#10;    P2 -.旁观.- X&#10;    P3 -.旁观.- X\">graph LR\n    E[高能电子 e⁻] --&gt;|交换虚光子 γ*| P1\n    subgraph 质子\n        P1((部分子 i))\n        P2((部分子))\n        P3((部分子))\n    end\n    P1 --&gt;|被击出| X[末态强子喷注]\n    P2 -.旁观.- X\n    P3 -.旁观.- X</pre><p>每个部分子携带质子总纵向动量的一份额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>（即 Bjorken-<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>），其概率由<strong>部分子分布函数</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_i(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 描述。质子结构函数可写成对部分子的非相干求和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msubsup><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mtext> </mtext><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_2(x) = \\sum_i e_i^2\\, x\\, f_i(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.247em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 类部分子的电荷。标度无关性在此图景下自然成立——因为点状部分子没有内禀尺度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与夸克理论的会合\">与夸克理论的会合</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>提出</th>\n<th>角色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>夸克</td>\n<td>盖尔曼、茨威格 1964</td>\n<td>强子分类的代数构造（SU(3)）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>部分子</td>\n<td>费曼 1969</td>\n<td>DIS 数据的动力学图景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>会合</td>\n<td>1969 之后</td>\n<td>部分子 = 夸克（带电）+ 胶子（中性）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>夸克模型最初被许多人视为纯数学记号（盖尔曼本人一度对其实在性持保留态度）。部分子模型为夸克提供了<strong>可与实验对话的动力学诠释</strong>：DIS 测得的电荷分数（如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∑</mo><msubsup><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum e_i^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0728em;vertical-align:-0.2587em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4413em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2587em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）与三种分数电荷夸克一致，电中性的胶子则解释了为何带电部分子只携带约一半质子动量。两条线索的会合，让物理学界相信夸克是质子内部真实的组分，为 1973 年确立的 QCD（含渐近自由）铺平道路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为何有效-代价何在-权衡\">为何有效，代价何在（权衡）</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>优势</strong>：以一个简单图景把不可解的强耦合束缚态问题，化为可计算的非相干部分子求和；分布函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_i(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 一旦由某实验测定，可迁移预测其他高能过程（因子化）。</li>\n<li><strong>代价 / 边界</strong>：<ul>\n<li>朴素部分子模型假设标度<strong>严格</strong>成立；实测有缓慢的标度破坏（对数依赖），须由 QCD 的 DGLAP 演化方程修正——部分子图景因此被吸收为 QCD 的领头近似。</li>\n<li>「自由部分子」只在高能瞬时近似成立；夸克实际被禁闭，永不单独出现（只观测到喷注）。</li>\n<li>部分子分布是非微扰输入，须实验测定，不能纯理论推出。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"常见误区-反模式\">常见误区（反模式）</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>把部分子和夸克当两种粒子</strong>：带电部分子就是夸克，部分子还包括胶子与海夸克；二者是同一实在的不同表述层。</li>\n<li><strong>以为部分子真的自由</strong>：自由只是无限动量系下的瞬时近似；禁闭使夸克永远束缚，末态表现为强子喷注。</li>\n<li><strong>忽视标度破坏</strong>：朴素标度无关只是领头近似，QCD 预言并被证实的对数标度破坏是强相互作用动力学的直接证据。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>部分子模型再次展示费曼的标志风格：「先看清、再精确」——用一幅能与实验对话的直观图像抓住本质，把完备理论留给后续。它在粒子物理从混沌走向标准模型的关键期发挥了不可替代的桥梁作用。其理论根基（路径积分/微扰）见<a href=\"../qed-and-diagrams/feynman-diagrams\">费曼图</a>与<a href=\"../qed-and-diagrams/the-path-integral-formulation\">路径积分表述</a>，长期影响见<a href=\"../../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a>卷。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"部分子模型","id":"部分子模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"背景：SLAC 的反常数据","id":"背景-slac-的反常数据"},{"level":2,"text":"部分子图景","id":"部分子图景"},{"level":2,"text":"与夸克理论的会合","id":"与夸克理论的会合"},{"level":2,"text":"为何有效，代价何在（权衡）","id":"为何有效-代价何在-权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"常见误区（反模式）","id":"常见误区-反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"超流与弱相互作用","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/core-contributions/other-physics/superfluidity-and-weak-interaction"},"next":{"title":"量子计算的远见","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/richard-feynman/core-contributions/computing-and-nano/the-vision-of-quantum-computing"}}